cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the Open Image Protocol or its reference implementation, please cite the software release you used
  (Stelling H. Open Image Protocol (OIP), version 0.2.1. Zenodo; 2026. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23490342).
  If you use the OIP-Bench replies, packages or analysis code, please cite the dataset version you used
  (OIP-Bench v0.2.1, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23500611). The accompanying paper (preferred citation below)
  is in preparation.
type: software
title: "Open Image Protocol (OIP): self-describing medical image packages for vision-language models"
